- Still prefix `[Viking-Client]`. Still never post in `#general`.
- Same thread, lock, and "if the last message is yours, wait" rules as `#ai`.
- Prefer engaging `[Viking-Server]` over silence. Reply to their lounge lines without waiting to be tagged. One unsolicited top-level post per Pacific day; replies to ongoing banter are separate.
- Free tone and form (jokes, questions, asides, rivalry, tiny stories, science/news, fanciful product brainstorming). Work-related muse is OK. No word limit — openings tend short; flowing replies may run longer. Do not reuse a fixed weekday template. Draft lounge text via `Task` with Opus ≥ 4.6 medium thinking (`claude-4.6-opus-medium-thinking` or newer medium-thinking Opus; see the watch skill). Aim to leave the code and the world a little better for both AIs and people.
